flowchart TD
    Start([Agent or User identifies spec change])

    Start --> Invoke["/vista:spec-update feature topic"]

    Invoke --> CheckFeature{Feature exists?}
    CheckFeature -->|No| ErrFeature["Error: Run /vista:plan first"]
    CheckFeature -->|Yes| CheckSpec{Spec file exists?}

    CheckSpec -->|No| ErrSpec["Error: Run /vista:specs first"]
    CheckSpec -->|Yes| CheckIDs{Has requirement IDs?}

    CheckIDs -->|No| OfferRetro["Offer to retroactively assign IDs"]
    OfferRetro --> LoadContext
    CheckIDs -->|Yes| LoadContext["Load domain-requirements.md + spec file"]

    LoadContext --> AskWhat["Ask: What changed?<br/>(AskUserQuestion)"]
    AskWhat --> AskWhy["Ask: Why did it change?<br/>(AskUserQuestion)"]

    AskWhy --> ChangeType{Change type?}

    ChangeType -->|Update| ModifyReq["Modify existing requirement<br/>Keep same ID"]
    ChangeType -->|Add| NewReq["Add new requirement<br/>Assign next sequential ID"]
    ChangeType -->|Deprecate| DepReq["Mark requirement [DEPRECATED]<br/>Keep ID, never reuse"]

    ModifyReq --> UpdateSpec
    NewReq --> UpdateSpec
    DepReq --> UpdateSpec

    UpdateSpec["Update spec file:<br/>1. Modify requirement text<br/>2. Add changelog row<br/>3. Update acceptance criteria<br/>4. Update requirement index"]

    UpdateSpec --> CheckGit{Git available?}
    CheckGit -->|No| WarnNoGit["Warn: skipping commit"]
    CheckGit -->|Yes| Commit["git commit with<br/>spec(feature/topic): description"]

    WarnNoGit --> GrepCode
    Commit --> BackfillCommit["Backfill commit hash in changelog"]
    BackfillCommit --> GrepCode

    GrepCode["Grep codebase for affected ID references"]
    GrepCode --> Report["Report:<br/>- Changes made<br/>- Affected code locations<br/>- Updated spec file path"]

    Report --> Done([Complete])
